      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For the Animator Locomotion Controller to work, you have to enable the avatar locomotion animations in Tracking and IK Settings. \n\nFor personal use, the solution is simply to turn it on and toggle off walking animations on avatar level, that way you can still lock your movement with the Animator Locomotion Controller.\n\nIf you on the other hand want to make assets for other users, it's a bit more difficult.\n\nI had the opportunity to talk with Tupper about this in person, and while he was surprised about the \"bug\", he eventually concluded that it makes sense for it to only work if Avatar Locomotion Animations are toggled on.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
