      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The link for aforementioned documentation:\n\nhttps://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/state-behaviors/#animator-locomotion-control\n\nTo reiterate, the non functional component is meant to disable player movement via WASD or thumbsticks, NOT for disabling the visual walking animations.",
